---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
                  <h2>COMPUTER ZOO</h2>
                  <p>
                    What do we mean on the term computer?  the very first picture of a computer is the desktop machine
                    standing on the table , or the laptop pc . however computers are of different types  and sizes because
                    of different market pushs and requirements(power cost, performance)
                 </p> 
                <p>the following are the different computers</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Disposable computer</li>
                        <li>MicroControllers</li>
                        <li>Mobile and game computers</li>
                        <li>Personal computers</li>
                        <li>Servers</li>
                        <li>Mainframes</li>
                    </ul>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
